{"id": "63552", "title": "宠妻／撩妻上瘾", "author": "闻笛同学", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 14, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/63/63552.htm", "intro": "本文又名《白日梦》\r\n周淮没有想到，宁盼安静无害的外表下，隐藏着一颗不受束缚的心。\r\n众人皆以为，宁盼入周家，是羊送虎口，兔入狼窝。\r\n实则，狡猾的小狐狸对上老谋深算的猎人，谁输谁赢，还说不定呢。\r\n简单点来说，就是宁盼被周家收养，却收服周淮的心。\r\n\r\n阅读提示：\r\n①本文涉及养成、强取豪夺等元素，重口味；\r\n②女主不白莲花、非善类，有仇报仇型；男主非处，双洁党慎 入；\r\n③先虐后宠，以宠为主\r\n\r\n内容标签：都市情缘 高干 豪门世家 强取豪夺", "base": "files/article/html/63/63552", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "9390807.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "9390808.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-16", "file": "9390809.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17-23", "file": "9390810.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24-28", "file": "9390812.html", "available": false}, {"title": "29-34", "file": "9390814.html", "available": false}, {"title": "35-39", "file": "9390817.html", "available": false}, {"title": "40-45", "file": "9390818.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "9390819.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "9390821.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "9390823.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "9390825.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-69", "file": "9390828.html", "available": false}, {"title": "70-71完结", "file": "9390829.html", "available": false}]}